wnKokXK/branch-shawn-add-photo","messageBody":"Update Shawn\u0027s profile in AboutUs.md","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"71e1444d7e13f9e51c3b7c20586fc27975bcdd99","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update DG with NFRs and glossary","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":51,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"e7b4866a2504ab541f8de69f612ec7226a45da5c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update DG with NFRs and glossary","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":7,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"2f2c6a07643adf78935dc243e7ce887023e90e6e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update NFRs and add glossary terms","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"ea9d9f7032f9700ca0786b8748e3d0344416896a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #29 from nerrad2004/update-readme","messageBody":"Update README.md","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-08T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"37905378f6400ec4ebe0f1176dd6f0d280d33bd4","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Replace AB3 model with students and lessons","messageBody":"The code was still AB3\u0027s address book of persons, which cannot hold\nstudents, lessons, enrollments or payments.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* replace Person with Student, Lesson and Enrollment, with separate ID\n  counters, and rewrite the model, storage and UI around them\n* replace the person commands with placeholders for add, delete, list,\n  mark and filter, wired into the parser\n* undo a command whose changes cannot be saved\n* add shared test fixtures and tests for the new model and storage\n* remove edit, find, clear and remark\n* add empty guide headings for each command\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":3377,"deletions":2252},"other":{"insertions":46,"deletions":51},"docs":{"insertions":67,"deletions":89},"test-code":{"insertions":3226,"deletions":3074}}},{"hash":"f7f57900b8a15ebb331d01357982ac47bf49176a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #44 from YourHand29/branch-delete-command","messageBody":"Add Delete Command","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"ae20b97e29ef492ea20d6ef760474e417b53eddb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Parse add command arguments","messageBody":"Parse all four forms of add, treating s/ and l/ as an ID when it is\na whole number and as a new name or subject otherwise\nReject malformed input with the specification\u0027s messages\nImplement unit tests for addCommand and AddCommandParser classes\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":248,"deletions":6},"test-code":{"insertions":409,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-15T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"2e5c88beae5c141e73d588af313d404b3f3dac20","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge upstream/master into branch-add-command","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"f12d0464c7b5e862fa232a622aa7753b0ff77914","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Enroll existing students in existing lessons","messageBody":"add parsed its arguments but could not carry out any request.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* enroll an existing student in an existing lesson, after checking\n  that both exist, that the student is not already enrolled and that\n  their levels match\n* report the student\u0027s payment status in the success message\n* run every check before changing anything, in the order the new\n  forms of add will also need, so a failed command changes nothing\n* test each failure, the order of the checks and the success cases\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":47,"deletions":1},"test-code":{"insertions":169,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"64daab0e2a6d4f3b1ec2d7e01055db6aac532836","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Create new students and lessons in add","messageBody":"add could only enroll existing students in existing lessons.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* create a new student, a new lesson, or both, and enroll the student\n  in the lesson, numbering students and lessons separately\n* reject a new student or lesson that duplicates an existing one, and a\n  new lesson that clashes with any existing lesson, allowing lessons\n  that start exactly when another ends\n* run every check before creating anything, so a failed command\n  creates nothing and uses no ID\n* check for duplicates before levels, and levels before clashes, so\n  the user sees the most helpful message first\n* test each form, each rule and the order in which the checks run\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":99,"deletions":20},"test-code":{"insertions":316,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"2158a2d2bb95a2a16c91ed9fcefc024b1ad42b37","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Document the add command in the User Guide","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":69,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"469a64a414aa9f807217a8388257af8131597352","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #52 from ShawnKokXK/branch-feature-filter","messageBody":"Update UserGuide.md for filter feature","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"909867c616dd180919bd80b6ae52c0143f9b5e71","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update version number for MVP release","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-22T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"4d559f1c5ab605ecc8c4a8d5ecb7568c18a3455f","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #72 from YourHand29/branch-schedule-command","messageBody":"Add Schedule feature","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"nerrad2004":{"docs":73,"functional-code":75,"test-code":102},"ShawnKokXK":{"docs":81,"functional-code":175,"test-code":200},"YourHand29":{"docs":102,"functional-code":597,"test-code":221,"other":1},"eeyang2026":{"docs":58,"functional-code":46,"test-code":87},"aintnoweii":{"docs":155,"functional-code":3612,"test-code":4026}}